# Project Core Cleanup & Reorganization

The `appforge-main` directory has accumulated many temporary, redundant, and misplaced files across multiple development phases. This plan outlines a comprehensive cleanup to restore project clarity and maintainability.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - Root testing scripts will be moved to `scripts/archive/testing/` to declutter the root.
> - [deno.exe](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/deno.exe) and [deno.zip](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/deno.zip) will be removed from the root to save space and reduce clutter.
> - Miscellaneous documentation will be moved to `docs/`.

